02:49:32,770 --> 02:49:34,240
"Dongbyeongsangryeon."

3769
02:49:34,240 --> 02:49:35,770
(Dongbyeongsangryeon)

3770
02:49:36,600 --> 02:49:37,810
That is correct.

3771
02:49:38,540 --> 02:49:39,540
It's over.

3772
02:49:39,540 --> 02:49:41,240
You get four points.

3773
02:49:41,240 --> 02:49:42,540
(Dongbyeongsangryeon)

3774
02:49:42,940 --> 02:49:44,580
- Was that it?
- Yes.

3775
02:49:44,580 --> 02:49:45,780
(Kwak Beom: 8, Shin Seung Yong: 16,
Park Ji Min: 6)

3776
02:49:46,110 --> 02:49:47,150
You've gone through so much...

3777
02:49:47,150 --> 02:49:48,880
- Great work, Seung Yong.
- to stay up this late.

3778
02:49:48,880 --> 02:49:51,490
You've gone through a lot as well.

3779
02:49:52,550 --> 02:49:54,020
You've gone through so much.

3780
02:49:55,490 --> 02:49:58,160
It was very disappointing
that I wasn't able...

3781
02:49:58,160 --> 02:50:01,030
to go to the semi-finals with Beom,

3782
02:50:01,130 --> 02:50:04,000
but I was able to achieve my main goal.

3783
02:50:04,600 --> 02:50:05,830
Well done.

3784
02:50:06,830 --> 02:50:08,740
It was quite disappointing.

3785
02:50:08,870 --> 02:50:12,340
This game was based on pure skill.

3786
02:50:12,340 --> 02:50:15,440
The two of us still did well
to do the revenge.

3787
02:50:15,980 --> 02:50:18,080
It would've been great to purge...

3788
02:50:18,810 --> 02:50:21,720
the one I had as a target.

3789
02:50:22,050 --> 02:50:24,120
It's quite disappointing
that I wasn't able to achieve that.

3790
02:50:24,120 --> 02:50:25,890
But as I did my best,

3791
02:50:25,890 --> 02:50:26,890
I have no regrets.

3792
02:50:26,890 --> 02:50:29,590
Seung Yong did well to win the game.

3793
02:50:30,360 --> 02:50:32,890
Although it's disappointing,

3794
02:50:33,030 --> 02:50:35,830
I perfectly acknowledge my defeat.

3795
02:50:37,100 --> 02:50:39,370
The Deathmatch has ended.

3796
02:50:40,500 --> 02:50:43,140
Everyone, please gather in the main hall.

3797
02:50:47,210 --> 02:50:50,080
The Deathmatch results
will now be announced.

3798
02:50:51,410 --> 02:50:54,650
The players eliminated
from Bloody Game X are...

3799
02:50:56,450 --> 02:50:57,520
Kwak Beom...

3800
02:50:57,520 --> 02:50:58,650
(Kwak Beom)

3801
02:50:58,650 --> 02:51:00,250
(Park Ji Min)

3802
02:51:00,250 --> 02:51:02,220
and Park Ji Min.

3803
02:51:02,220 --> 02:51:03,460
(Park Ji Min)

3804
02:51:04,460 --> 02:51:07,230
Kwak Beom and Park Ji Min,

3805
02:51:07,260 --> 02:51:08,730
please pack your bags immediately...

3806
02:51:08,730 --> 02:51:10,970
and leave the Bloody Mansion.

3807
02:51:11,000 --> 02:51:14,800
Eliminated players can never return
to Bloody Game X.

3808
02:51:14,900 --> 02:51:16,540
I failed to wing it.

3809
02:51:16,540 --> 02:51:17,840
It didn't work out.

3810
02:51:17,840 --> 02:51:19,110
Make the purge happen tomorrow.

3811
02:51:19,640 --> 02:51:21,210
We weren't able to be on the same team
until the end.

3812
02:51:21,210 --> 02:51:23,140
- Not even once.
- Exactly.

3813
02:51:23,610 --> 02:51:24,910
- Fit me in next time.
- Right.

3814
02:51:24,910 --> 02:51:26,410
- Of course.
- Right.

3815
02:51:26,810 --> 02:51:29,050
I felt relieved with everything...

3816
02:51:29,050 --> 02:51:31,150
after experiencing the Deathmatch.

3817
02:51:31,450 --> 02:51:33,420
I believe Bloody Game...

3818
02:51:33,420 --> 02:51:36,620
has all types of human figures.

3819
02:51:36,890 --> 02:51:38,930
There are those who are incredibly clever.

3820
02:51:39,390 --> 02:51:40,660
I couldn't find a single one.

3821
02:51:42,030 --> 02:51:44,000
But there are people like me as well.

3822
02:51:44,730 --> 02:51:46,700
I wanted to show people
that I could survive...

3823
02:51:46,700 --> 02:51:48,300
even with a lack of brainpower.

3824
02:51:49,940 --> 02:51:51,740
The moment I want to relive?

3825
02:51:51,740 --> 02:51:53,980
It has to be the Mafia Game.

3826
02:51:54,110 --> 02:51:57,250
"The arrest of the killer
has been successful."

3827
02:52:00,920 --> 02:52:02,550
I want to relive that moment.

3828
02:52:02,550 --> 02:52:03,690
The dopamine I felt during that moment.

3829
02:52:03,690 --> 02:52:07,060
"Why do the same people
keep appearing on survival shows?"

3830
02:52:07,060 --> 02:52:08,820
"Why is that person on every single time?"

3831
02:52:09,260 --> 02:52:10,360
It's an addiction.

3832
02:52:11,390 --> 02:52:12,630
A dopamine addiction.

3833
02:52:13,390 --> 02:52:14,460
Let's say...

3834
02:52:14,600 --> 02:52:16,930
it's a sport.

3835
02:52:17,300 --> 02:52:20,400
One can play soccer
until they run out of breath...

3836
02:52:20,400 --> 02:52:22,100
or ride a bike at dangerous speeds...

3837
02:52:22,100 --> 02:52:24,610
to feel this sense of thrill.

3838
02:52:24,710 --> 02:52:25,810
But here,

3839
02:52:26,810 --> 02:52:28,580
that thrill can be felt
while sitting in my seat.

3840
02:52:30,140 --> 02:52:32,910
It was the greatest level of dopamine
I could've experienced.

3841
02:52:34,320 --> 02:52:37,490
I feel thankful to be able to participate
in such an exciting game.

3842
02:52:38,550 --> 02:52:39,690
I had fun.

3843
02:52:40,620 --> 02:52:43,860
I wasn't able to thank you earlier.

3844
02:52:44,560 --> 02:52:45,730
Thank you so much.

3845
02:52:46,360 --> 02:52:47,430
Let's meet after your win.

3846
02:52:47,430 --> 02:52:48,560
Either one of you must win.

3847
02:52:51,070 --> 02:52:54,300
- Me? The last man standing from P1?
- Right.

3848
02:52:54,300 --> 02:52:55,600
This makes no sense at all.

3849
02:52:55,600 --> 02:52:56,900
Head home first.

3850
02:52:56,900 --> 02:52:58,540
Right. I'll see you outside.

3851
02:53:00,210 --> 02:53:01,740
It was very sad.

3852
02:53:01,880 --> 02:53:03,340
When it's time for someone to leave,

3853
02:53:03,340 --> 02:53:04,880
all the times of joy and sorrow...

3854
02:53:04,880 --> 02:53:07,150
flash by in an instant.

3855
02:53:08,380 --> 02:53:10,750
After joining Bloody Game X,

3856
02:53:10,990 --> 02:53:12,920
it felt like a grand connection...

3857
02:53:12,920 --> 02:53:16,920
of all three seasons of Bloody Game.

3858
02:53:17,460 --> 02:53:20,260
The moments of Season One flashed by.

3859
02:53:21,030 --> 02:53:26,070
(Ji Min was a key player
in Bloody Game 1 5 years ago.)

3860
02:53:27,340 --> 02:53:29,600
The moments of Season Two
flashed by as well.

3861
02:53:30,510 --> 02:53:35,540
(She went across both sides
as a spy in Season 2.)

3862
02:53:35,640 --> 02:53:37,410
I can be a great liar.

3863
02:53:37,680 --> 02:53:40,250
I was a dealer in Season Three.

3864
02:53:41,320 --> 02:53:44,620
She's the lady of the house
in Bloody Game.

3865
02:53:44,690 --> 02:53:47,420
I was able to be with the ones...

3866
02:53:47,420 --> 02:53:49,790
I spent time with years ago.

3867
02:53:49,920 --> 02:53:51,890
- Pay me back! Thank you!
- I will.

3868
02:53:52,360 --> 02:53:55,360
It felt like I went back in time
to when I was that age.

3869
02:53:55,500 --> 02:53:57,030
I really had a great time.

3870
02:53:57,770 --> 02:53:59,530
As it was a team battle,

3871
02:54:00,230 --> 02:54:03,540
I was able to experience something I have
never experienced in the previous seasons.

3872
02:54:05,540 --> 02:54:09,010
There was a greater sense
of pleasure and joy.

3873
02:54:11,650 --> 02:54:13,980
There was also a great sense of rage.

3874
02:54:15,520 --> 02:54:19,090
I believe Bloody Game X...

3875
02:54:19,220 --> 02:54:23,160
will become the strongest memory
in my head.

3876
02:54:23,960 --> 02:54:27,860
Many people recognize me
because of Bloody Game.

3877
02:54:28,500 --> 02:54:33,200
I've met many of my supporters
through Bloody Game.

3878
02:54:33,800 --> 02:54:37,210
I think that was why I wanted
to show even more.

3879
02:54:37,970 --> 02:54:42,280
I believe I was able to go through
experiences and emotions...

3880
02:54:42,280 --> 02:54:45,150
that one might never experience in life.

3881
02:54:45,250 --> 02:54:47,380
I feel grateful for that...

3882
02:54:47,580 --> 02:54:50,590
and I won't be able to forget...

3883
02:54:50,820 --> 02:54:53,350
this season's Bloody Mansion.

3884
02:54:53,890 --> 02:54:55,360
- I'll see you outside.
- Great work.

3885
02:54:55,360 --> 02:54:56,460
Great work.

3886
02:54:57,020 --> 02:55:00,330
Gosh, I arrested the murderer yesterday
as the cop.

3887
02:55:00,390 --> 02:55:01,900
I'm actually taking her out now.

3888
02:55:02,730 --> 02:55:04,100
- Let's go.
- Right.

3889
02:55:04,200 --> 02:55:05,370
- Let's go.
- Right.

3890
02:55:10,100 --> 02:55:11,240
Great work.

3891
02:55:11,240 --> 02:55:12,970
- Great work.
- Right.

3892
02:55:13,270 --> 02:55:16,940
Things got intense toward the end.

3893
02:55:17,040 --> 02:55:18,950
I'm not the key figure.

3894
02:55:19,150 --> 02:55:20,650
Why do they all think that I am?

3895
02:55:20,650 --> 02:55:23,050
Right. That means YunB did well
to play the game.

3896
02:55:23,080 --> 02:55:24,220
Right.

3897
02:55:27,660 --> 02:55:30,860
Eight of you have survived
after all of the games.

3898
02:55:31,290 --> 02:55:32,490
Congratulations.

3899
02:55:33,390 --> 02:55:37,630
Tomorrow, the finalists of Bloody Game X
will be decided...

3900
02:55:37,630 --> 02:55:39,400
through the semi-finals.

3901
02:55:42,300 --> 02:55:43,800
"It's already the semi-finals?"

3902
02:55:43,840 --> 02:55:45,810
"Players will get eliminated
without mercy."

3903
02:55:45,810 --> 02:55:48,240
"I must stay on my toes from now on."

3904
02:55:48,240 --> 02:55:50,540
With my next plays,

3905
02:55:50,540 --> 02:55:52,150
I want to achieve a clean win...

3906
02:55:52,150 --> 02:55:54,080
which everyone will acknowledge.

3907
02:55:54,150 --> 02:55:57,350
I thought that I made it really far in.

3908
02:55:57,350 --> 02:55:59,990
When I first participated,

3909
02:56:00,250 --> 02:56:02,960
I said that I would be satisfied...

3910
02:56:02,960 --> 02:56:04,890
just to be able to reach the semi-finals.

3911
02:56:05,030 --> 02:56:07,460
After reaching the semi-finals,

3912
02:56:07,460 --> 02:56:09,000
I thought to myself,

3913
02:56:09,000 --> 02:56:10,700
"Will I be able to become to winner?"

3914
02:56:11,630 --> 02:56:14,140
No matter what game it is,
it'll be an individual battle.

3915
02:56:14,140 --> 02:56:17,910
It's a survival that's only meaningful
for the winner.

3916
02:56:18,140 --> 02:56:19,970
"I will go my way."

3917
02:56:19,970 --> 02:56:21,640
"No one should get in my way."

3918
02:56:21,910 --> 02:56:23,710
In Season Three,

3919
02:56:23,710 --> 02:56:26,050
I got eliminated
right before the semi-finals...

3920
02:56:26,050 --> 02:56:27,520
and I felt really disappointed.

3921
02:56:27,580 --> 02:56:29,850
My goal is obviously
to become the champion.

3922
02:56:29,850 --> 02:56:32,450
I must do my best.

3923
02:56:34,390 --> 02:56:35,420
I did feel nervous...

3924
02:56:35,420 --> 02:56:38,230
as I reached the semi-finals.

3925
02:56:38,230 --> 02:56:39,360
"I want to reach the finals."

3926
02:56:39,360 --> 02:56:40,530
I had this desire.

3927
02:56:40,530 --> 02:56:42,260
Whatever game is played,

3928
02:56:42,960 --> 02:56:45,670
I must do my best to stay focused
and to do well.

3929
02:56:45,770 --> 02:56:48,600
I must reach the finals
since I've made it this far.

3930
02:56:49,900 --> 02:56:51,140
Semi-finals?

3931
02:56:51,140 --> 02:56:52,310
With 7 players? No, with 8 players?

3932
02:56:52,570 --> 02:56:53,640
There are too many.

3933
02:56:53,640 --> 02:56:54,640
I must advance one more time...

3934
02:56:54,640 --> 02:56:56,610
to be able to say I have achieved my goal.

3935
02:56:59,910 --> 02:57:03,220
I don't think there's a chance for me
to get eliminated.

3936
02:57:03,990 --> 02:57:05,420
With the ones left,

3937
02:57:05,420 --> 02:57:08,460
I feel confident
to be able to beat every single one.

3938
02:57:08,860 --> 02:57:11,330
I will definitely make it to the finals.

3939
02:57:12,930 --> 02:57:14,130
I must...

3940
02:57:14,530 --> 02:57:15,530
become the champion.

3941
02:57:15,530 --> 02:57:16,630
I was known...

3942
02:57:17,130 --> 02:57:18,670
just as a calculator.

3943
02:57:19,030 --> 02:57:20,740
I was Ji Hoo-PT.

3944
02:57:20,740 --> 02:57:24,670
My heart that was empty...

3945
02:57:24,770 --> 02:57:27,740
has been filled
thanks to the love and sacrifice...

3946
02:57:28,110 --> 02:57:31,280
of the members of Team C and Team Rookie.

3947
02:57:31,410 --> 02:57:34,280
Just for the sake of giving joy...

3948
02:57:35,050 --> 02:57:36,750
to the ones who loved and trusted me,

3949
02:57:36,750 --> 02:57:38,290
I must...

3950
02:57:38,620 --> 02:57:39,920
become the champion.

3951
02:57:43,420 --> 02:57:46,460
Prepare for tomorrow's semi-finals.

3952
02:59:08,340 --> 02:59:10,740
